    <briefdescription>
<para>Translation of the JET PPF equilibrium data into dg-compatible format. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>1st arg == shot number</para><para>2nd arg == time</para><para>[3rd arg == DDA (EFIT)]</para><para>[4th arg == PPFUID (JETPPF)]</para><para>[5th arg == edition (0)]</para><para>The output filename is derived from the shot, time, experiment, diagnostic and edition</para><para>Specific JET library routines are used to access the data</para><para><simplesect kind="version"><para>2008-07-17 16:15 </para></simplesect>
</para>    </detaileddescription>
